  "description": "Choi U-Seok, a doctor of agricultural science who had been left alone in the emptiness of life, opens his eyes to find himself back in his high school days in Napa Valley, California! \n\nBut what awaits him is a grape farm that has gone bankrupt due to droughts and pests. In this desperate situation, U-Seok takes a huge gamble, using immigrant assistance programs and loans to acquire the farm… \n\nCan he really transform this devastated vineyard? \n\n(Source: Naver translated)",
